{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your party. Shape your fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to play Dungeons &amp; Dragons but found gathering a group too hard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This card-based RPG captures the same spirit of adventure and non-linear storytelling, presented in a tabletop-style format you can enjoy solo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your character:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class and distribute your starting stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers unique gameplay and builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three decks \u2013 endless combinations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings a new adventure with Location, Event, and Item cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location scales with your level and holds its own set of unique events and hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you draw an event card, you have to pick one of two actions, each requiring a specific stat. Roll a D20 to determine success or failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain items that boost your stats or grant abilities capable of turning the tide of the game. Use them wisely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a dark fantasy world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what plunged it into darkness and define your role within it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Form a party and fight enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In certain events, you\u2019ll battle alongside your party, using special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the way you want:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn villages and walk the path of destruction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or become a hero determined to mend the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002790?t=1760715027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002790?t=1760715027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/0730a263aec3501848f8b81149b77f92863fc52f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760715027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/0730a263aec3501848f8b81149b77f92863fc52f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760715027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Warband & Magic is a dark fantasy game that includes depictions of violence, blood, and other mature themes. Some content may be disturbing or inappropriate for younger audiences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your party. Shape your fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to play Dungeons &amp; Dragons but found gathering a group too hard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This card-based RPG captures the same spirit of adventure and non-linear storytelling, presented in a tabletop-style format you can enjoy solo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your character:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class and distribute your starting stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/2ae81989e6ad66d1b2bdd961a67596b0.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers unique gameplay and builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three decks \u2013 endless combinations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings a new adventure with Location, Event, and Item cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location scales with your level and holds its own set of unique events and hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/7d75c63b95f10c7490e6b42aa8ac0171.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you draw an event card, you have to pick one of two actions, each requiring a specific stat. Roll a D20 to determine success or failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/0070d372ea09221b25a76c2adba9889f.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain items that boost your stats or grant abilities capable of turning the tide of the game. Use them wisely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5feb2e8b9ef7f6666037856e313cf248.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a dark fantasy world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what plunged it into darkness and define your role within it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Form a party and fight enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In certain events, you\u2019ll battle alongside your party, using special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/5c08414aab4d38096d3c52d3f219fbbd.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.poster.avif?t=1760715027\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.webm?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/extras/8d530135f0736225140e7c54166294b9.mp4?t=1760715027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the way you want:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn villages and walk the path of destruction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or become a hero determined to mend the world.</p>","developers":["Warband & Magic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002790/10f0dcd93d6f8f4bd0ee6f47ded21f0dc407f057/header.jpg?t=1760715027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 / 20.04 LTS or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core x64 with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ / Vulkan-capable GPU (Intel HD 4000 +)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or modern distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Mid-range GPU (NVIDIA GTX 950 / AMD RX 550 +)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Big Sur 11.0+<br></li